WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:04.933
EVERY 3D WORLD STARTS WITH A LINE.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.833
First, 3D WAS JUST LINES.

3
00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:25.667
THEN IT GOT SURFACES.

4
00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:32.833
Then IT GOT SKIN.

5
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.733
BEAUTIFUL — BUT HOURS PER FRAME, ON ROOMS OF MACHINES.

6
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:53.733
Then IT CAME ALIVE — IN REAL TIME.

7
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:03.833
YOU COULD WALK AROUND IT. PUT IT IN YOUR ROOM.

8
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.933
— IF YOU HAD THE RIGHT APP AND THE RIGHT MACHINE.

9
00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:19.500
Now 3D IS JUST A LINK.

10
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:23.733
NO APP. ANY SCREEN.

11
00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:30.000
From bulky hardware TO A SHAREABLE LINK.
